      "quote": "In production systems, it is common to employ another LLM for evaluation so that the evaluation step can be separate from the generation summaries."
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "quote": "In this example, we chain two LLMs in a sequence, where the output from the first LLM serves as the input for the second LLM."
    },
